umbrawg-linux-kmod (1:0.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Export BBR/FEC counters and BBR statistics over netlink.
  * Bind BBR ring state to the keypair and ignore ACKs from an old keypair.
  * Derive FEC shard budget and TUN MTU from the configured underlay MTU.
  * Apply cwnd as a loss-informed ACK-clocked gate.
  * Treat an all-zero header protection key as disabled.
  * Restrict unknown-peer multicast to CAP_NET_ADMIN and rate-limit events.
  * Cap the learned UDP window and keep the initiation rate limit with cookies off.
  * Add FEC/extension self-tests and a KUnit suite.

 -- Alex Ivlev <ai@itegroup.ru>  Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:00:00 +0300

umbrawg-linux-kmod (1:0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add BBRv3 pacing and Reed-Solomon FEC for kernel data-plane.
  * Add CAPS/ACK feedback, adaptive 2:1 FEC and netlink BBR/FEC attributes.
  * Fix FEC profile validation, timer teardown and MTU budget.

 -- Alex Ivlev <ai@itegroup.ru>  Fri, 20 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0300

